# GitHub cannot host this project's full raw archive safely:
# the original folders are ~34GB and several PDFs exceed GitHub's 100MB file limit.
# Keep the deployable museum app, generated thumbnails, catalog metadata, docs, and BAT scripts tracked.

.online-museum-server.pid
.online-museum-server.port
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
qa-*.png
qa-screenshots/
*.log
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
__pycache__/
*.pyc

